From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] filament: add bounded async SOLUM framegraph GPU profiler

Base: google/filament v1.71.4@a0ecdbbeba5f1005bbad0a4c8b2fe6955788cdee

Debug-only and disabled by default. Uses backend TimerQuery scopes around the accepted
frame, named View, and a rotating bounded window of real active FrameGraph passes.
The 20-handle budget respects the v1.71.4 Vulkan 32-timer pool and its four FrameInfo
owners. Results are polled asynchronously; the profiler never waits for GPU completion.
JSON marks nested timings as non-additive and reports coverage, pending, dropped and error
scope counts.

